# UI/UX design theme — Decent Technologies (light)

Dense, data-forward **standard enterprise** style. Light canvas, **navy primary**
CTAs, logo **crimson as accent only**. Color reserved for brand + status — not
decoration.

**Source of truth:** root `DESIGN.md` (read before UI work).

**Consistency first:** every page must feel like the same product — see
`03-ui-consistency.mdc`.

## Color tokens (use as CSS variables, never hardcode hex in components)

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--color-primary` | #172747 | Primary buttons, links, focus |
| `--color-primary-hover` | #243a5c | Hover |
| `--color-primary-pressed` | #0f1a2e | Pressed |
| `--color-primary-light` | #e8ecf2 | Soft selected fills |
| `--color-navy` / `--color-primary-dark` | #172747 | Headers, sidebar, ink |
| `--color-accent` | #d91a22 | Nav rail, charts, brand accent only |
| `--color-accent-soft` | #FDE9EA | Rare soft accent chips |
| `--color-sidebar-bg` | #ffffff | Light sidebar chrome |
| `--color-logo-plate` | #000000 | Logo / login brand only (never mix with sidebar) |
| `--color-success` | #1b6e3a | Approved, completed, on-time |
| `--color-warning` | #9a6700 | On hold, correction raised, due soon |
| `--color-danger` | #a41a24 | Rejected, overdue, validation errors |
| `--color-info` | #026aa7 | Informational banners |
| `--color-neutral-900` | #172747 | Primary body text |
| `--color-neutral-500` | #64748b | Secondary text, captions |
| `--color-page-canvas` | #F5F6F8 | Page background |
| `--color-surface` | #FFFFFF | Card / table background |
| `--color-border` | #DCE3EC | Borders |

## Logo

- Transparent PNGs: `/brand/logo.png`, `/brand/logo-mark.png`
- Favicons: `/favicon/*` (+ root `/favicon.ico` for browsers)
- Paths: `@/config/brand-assets` → `BrandLogo` / root `layout` metadata
- Sidebar: mark + “Decent ERP” on white — no black box
- Login: mark on navy brand panel; mark on light form (mobile)

## Typography (same on every page)

- Font: Inter or Roboto, `system-ui` fallback.
- H1 24px/semibold (PageHeader), H2 18px/semibold (AppCard / section).
- Body 14px, caption 12px muted, KPI 20–28px semibold tabular-nums.

## Layout & components

- Left sidebar + top bar; content via `.page-shell`.
- Cards: `AppCard`; tables: `DataTable` / `.app-table`.
- Buttons: `AppButton` — primary = navy, not crimson.
- Active sidebar: white wash + crimson left rail.
- Theme is **light only**.

## Accessibility

- WCAG 2.1 AA; white text on navy primary buttons; crimson only for accent/danger.
